    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d335">

                <pb facs="0307" n="295" xml:id="pg295"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.24/199a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Dreyfus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-05-01T18:00:00-04:00">May 1, 1942—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>109. Designation of Iran as eligible for Lend-Lease assistance will be announced
                    publicly by White House May 2.<anchor n="18" xml:id="d335-f1"/> Iranian Minister
                    in Washington has been informed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d335-f1" n="18" xml:id="d335-f1-content">
                <p>For text of announcement, which concerned lend-lease aid to both Iran and Iraq,
                    see Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, May 2, 1942, p.
                    383.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
